    "cause": "ts-jest (TypeScript CommonJS emit) kept each import at its source position, so the late import of ../main.ipc, ../main.window and ../main.behavior ran after the const mock* objects existed; SWC hoists imports (ES module order), so electron was required, and the hoisted jest.mock factory read those consts, while they were still in their temporal dead zone",
